-- Equalizer schema v19: adds 5 original "belt-and-pulley rotation
-- direction" questions -- a mechanism (crossed vs. open/direct belts)
-- that did not exist anywhere in the bank. Each diagram was built from
-- real geometry (tangent lines computed from each pulley's actual
-- center/radius), not hand-drawn approximations, so a crossed belt
-- genuinely crosses between the two pulleys in the image and an open
-- belt genuinely does not -- verified visually at full size before
-- writing this migration. Every question asks about a different pair
-- and belt type than the sample and than each other (2 open-belt pairs,
-- 3 crossed-belt pairs), and the rule applied is the standard one for
-- belt drives: an open belt keeps both pulleys turning the same
-- direction; a crossed belt reverses it.
--
-- Per instruction, this migration does NOT remove any duplicate
-- questions -- it only adds, bringing the total question count from 225
-- (after migrations_v18.sql) to 230.

insert into public.questions (subject, category, question, options, answer_index, explanation, diagram_svg) values

